s having…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/choice-hotels-international-inc-chh-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"CHH 2024 Q4","e":"chh","d":"2025-02-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Pat Pacious","x":"Traction in the technology vertical is particularly encouraging and we believe we have a meaningful long-term opportunity to capture growing demand for both the technology and energy related sectors driven in part by the significant infrastructure investments required by GenAI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/choice-hotels-chh-q4-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2025 Q3","e":"chh","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"In the U.S., we expect last week's lowering of interest rates, continued investments in the build-out of AI infrastructure, and a constructive regulatory environment will drive stronger demand, especially for our travelers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/choice-hotels-chh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2025 Q3","e":"chh","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott E. Oaksmith","x":"In addition, there were some items that really were grossed up pass-through type expenses and revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/choice-hotels-chh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2025 Q3","e":"chh","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott E. Oaksmith","x":"If you took a look at our SG&A in the quarter, it was a little more elevated really mainly due to those pass-through items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/choice-hotels-chh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2025 Q3","e":"chh","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"…cloud computing and data to evolve Choice's technology stack into an intelligent, always-on ecosystem, one where autonomous agents continuously help franchisees optimize rate and revenue management, streamline operations, and free franchisees to focus on delivering exceptional guest experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/choice-hotels-chh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2025 Q3","e":"chh","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"In addition, we're developing new AI-enabled RFP management and sales tools designed to streamline group sales, accelerate responsiveness, and drive more high-value bookings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/choice-hotels-chh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q1","e":"chh","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"Technology is an increasingly important differentiator for Choice Hotels International, Inc. We have a long-standing advantage, having been an early mover in migrating both our infrastructure and data to the cloud, which underpins how we deploy AI across our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/choice-hotels-chh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q1","e":"chh","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"We are likely the only company that has both our infrastructure and our data all on the cloud—two key ingredients to bring AI to the enterprise at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/choice-hotels-chh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q1","e":"chh","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"We have seen travel impacted by government shutdowns, tariffs, and other factors not in anyone’s forecast.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/choice-hotels-chh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q1","e":"chh","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrick S. Pacious","x":"Then, on top of that, as owners get more comfortable with the demand environment, they raise price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/choice-hotels-chh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q1","e":"chh","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott E. Oaksmith","x":"As a result, we are maintaining our outlook across all key metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/choice-hotels-chh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q1","e":"chh","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott E. Oaksmith","x":"For full year 2026, we are maintaining our guidance across all metrics, including adjusted EBITDA of $632 million to $647 million and adjusted diluted earnings per share of $6.92 to $7.14.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/choice-hotels-chh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q2","e":"chh","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Charles Scholes","x":"So just passing that on, and I appreciate your consideration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/choice-hotels-chh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q2","e":"chh","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dominic Dragisich","x":"As a result, we're raising our full year outlook across several metrics, including adjusted EBITDA, U.S. and global RevPAR, U.S. royalty rate and global net rooms growth, which Scott will cover shortly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/choice-hotels-chh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHH 2026 Q2","e":"chh","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Oaksmith","x":"Based on our second quarter performance and the underlying operating trends we've discussed today, we are raising our full year guidance for adjusted EBITDA, U.S. RevPAR, U.S. average royalty rate and global net rooms growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcr